<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile to offer heava rubber on April 24.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile to offer heava rubber on April 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Defense Stockpile Center said that 13,928.53 long tons of technically specified heava (TSR) rubber would be offered on April 24.</p>
<p>If all the rubber is not sold in April, any remaining material would be offered on the fourth Thursday of each subsequent month until the rubber is sold.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
